      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The default Contact senders that are defined in your VRC Avatar Descriptor are not actually there in Unity, you can only see where they would end up in game. \nThis means that everything that should interact with them can only be tested in client and not in Unity. A way to get around is to manually add the Contact Senders with the feet tag to the feet for testing it in Unity, but don't forget to remove them before you upload.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
