      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Similar situation, created a simple animation for the steps, where the trigger was a signal from the Receiver, which should receive a collision when interacting with the standard Sender Foot L/R, but nothing happens. However, if you add a separate Sender script, everything works. Developers, please fix this or if this is an inaccuracy in the documentation, point out this limitation.",
