  "details": "Someone in the discord wanted to make footstep sounds, and  I tried to help them and found an issue. A contact using your own built-in contact senders doesn't seem to be working. The contact in the vid below is set to \"torso\" , and not going off and triggering the below layer made for it to trigger, you can see on the right that it's bool is false. This is on play mode. \nhttps://i.gyazo.com/e6f6fb070f74d84b91a296c42fa9efb3.mp4\n\nthe picture below includes the previous test, with a capsule and the feet, with the capsule set to \"foot\" and allow local. Yet it wasn't triggering either.",
